# Packing live files

App DB in `database/order-packing-list-generator/`. Input stays in the app folder; Logs/Output are warehouse-root. Shared joins via `shared/paths.py`.

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `database/order-packing-list-generator/Workbook.xlsx` | Process sheets (CL Database sheet archive-only) |
| `database/order-packing-list-generator/New SKU Database.csv` | DTF Des Item-SKU remap |
| `database/order-packing-list-generator/All Orders.csv` | Cumulative run log |
| `database/shared/shipstation_tags/ShipStation_Tags.xlsx` | Tags → process# (shared) |
| `database/shared/custom_label/Custom_Label_Database.csv` | Enrich |
| `Order Packing List Generator/Input/` | App-local intake; runtime CSVs gitignored; `README.md` tracked |
| `Order Packing List Generator/Missing Logos/` | Holding CSVs for missing logos; runtime gitignored; `README.md` tracked |
| `Order Packing List Generator/Missing Apparels/` | Report CSVs for missing apparels (packing continues); runtime gitignored; `README.md` tracked |
| `Order Packing List Generator/Unmatched SKUs/` | Step-4 unmatched CSVs; runtime gitignored; `README.md` tracked |
| `Order Packing List Generator/Preflight Issues/` | Preflight Issues CSVs; runtime gitignored; `README.md` tracked |
| `Order Packing List Generator/Missing Input/Missing Input.csv` | Tracked header-only template for missing-run queries |
| `Output/Order Packing List Generator/` | Packing run outputs (Excel / PDFs / DTF Des) |
| `Logs/Order Packing List Generator/` | Packing run logs |
| `runtime/SharedInbox/DTF Des/{date}/{shift}/` | DTF Des dual-write |
| `config/ShipStation/.env` | ShipStation credentials |
| `database/order-packing-list-generator/gui_config.json` (+ missing/preflight JSON) | GUI remember-last settings (gitignored) |
| `database/order-packing-list-generator/Back Print.jpg` | Packing-list PDF back-print reference (tracked) |
